  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Trying to share older UI theme palettes, either by pedestal, or direct sharing, causes VRChat to give an \"Unusual Client Behavior\" error, and kicks user from instance.\n\nPalettes attempted to be shared were UI palettes created when UI themes first were available, and still had their original names displayed. Sharing palettes that were shared with me, or created afterwards, did not create the error. \n\nChanging the name of the palettes stopped the error from occurring.\n\nRecent changes might lead into why sharing these palettes give this error, either with drone customizations, or due to a reduction in number of characters to a palette's name. The latter was something I recently noticed, as the displayed name of the palettes exceeded the number of characters allowed as I went to change their name.",
